# Differential graded modules over a differential graded algebra

The category `Mod_(A, d)` of right differential graded modules over a differential graded algebra
`(A, d)` is abelian, complete and cocomplete. The definitions and the preadditive structure are in
`StacksFrontier.Algebra.DGA.Abelian.Basic`, kernels, cokernels and the normality of monomorphisms and
epimorphisms in `StacksFrontier.Algebra.DGA.Abelian.KernelCokernel`, products and direct sums in
`StacksFrontier.Algebra.DGA.Abelian.ProductCoproduct`, and the main results in
`StacksFrontier.Algebra.DGA.Abelian.AbelianComplete`.
-/
